{"id":"vod_hh_65881","vodId":"65881","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"绝园的暴风雨","name_cn":"绝园的暴风雨","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/f4abd0461a46858c25c67fba44827f91.jpg"},"summary":"魔法使一族的野心使他们为了获取更强的力量，促使他们唤醒了不该唤醒的东西，世界的毁灭近在眼前。只有最强的魔法使公主锁部叶风（泽城美雪 配音）才能阻止这一切的发生，但被部下锁部左门（小山力也 配音）暗算的叶风被困在了施了结界的无人岛上。高中二年级学生泷川吉野（内山昂辉 配音）的好友不破真广（丰永利行 配音）的妹妹不破爱花（花泽香菜 配音）被入室抢劫犯所杀，但是真广却认为妹妹的死疑点重重。为了调查妹妹的死因，真广通过海上的漂流人偶和锁部叶风达成秘密交易。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-07-10 18:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeX00DWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0mmRva/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwAAjRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejkkRRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penooZRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6vvonb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepqqY2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdG2267b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4qqx1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaO22Ype/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyDDP7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penooZla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6vvX9b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aK22Zne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVkkm1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelmm56a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8xx6ob/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/pl